      "### 2. WhatsApp integration",
      "In Kenya, WhatsApp is where enquiries become sales. Every page should have a click-to-chat button that opens a conversation with your business — ideally pre-filled with what the visitor was viewing (\"Hi, I'd like to book the deluxe room for 2 nights\"). It's the single highest-converting feature on Kenyan websites.",
